example:
消费方依赖的是接口。运行时对象是代理，deduct 进入过滤器、集群容错、负载均衡和协议：

```java
public interface InventoryService {
    void deduct(String sku, int qty);
}

@Service
public class OrderApp {
    @DubboReference(version = "1.0.0", group = "order")
    private InventoryService inventory;

    public void reserve(String sku) {
        inventory.deduct(sku, 1);
    }
}
```
